#美国结束政府停摆 #ETH Bollinger Bands indicator under the short-term trading trend judgment: Price is near the upper band + standing above the middle band → Short-term bullish trend prevails. The long-term trend is still bearish.
Resistance/Support:
Resistance: Bollinger Bands upper band 3589.66, if broken, can see short-term continuation of the rise;
Support: Bollinger Bands middle band 3526.62, if held during a pullback, the trend remains strong.
If the price falls back to near the middle band and finds support, it can be seen as a buying opportunity;
If the price touches the upper band and then falls back, while KDJ is overbought, caution is needed for short-term pullback risks.
